<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 15.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 15.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 15	May 14   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  270.060     272.210     247.020    9.33 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  311.400     311.200     306.830    1.49 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.740     159.480     158.970    0.48 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.440	47.374	47.182    0.55 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  442.780     446.000     419.180    5.63 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.200     141.845     141.685    0.36 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.236	16.188	16.185    0.32 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  233.780     229.370     212.430   10.05 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.893	 1.891	 1.888    0.26 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.586	 1.584	 1.581    0.32 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.265     188.180     183.135    3.35 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
